{{also|Feminist}}
==English==

===Etymology===
Ultimately from {{etyl|la}} ''[[femininus|féminīnus]]'', from ''[[femina|fémina]]'' (woman). (See ''[[feminine]]''). ''Feminist'' first recorded in English 1894, from French ''[[féministe]]'' (1872). See also ''[[feminism]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfɛmənɪst/}}, {{SAMPA|/"fEm@nIst/}}

